        {
          "doc": "Also raised when the oracle *is* fresh but returns a non-positive reference value --\\n`is_available()` only attests freshness, not positivity, and this contract must not\\ntrust the latter blindly (defense-in-depth against a buggy/compromised oracle; found\\nduring an audit review).",
          "name": "OracleStale",
          "value": 10
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
