          "value": 11
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "IssuerMismatch",
          "value": 12
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "RecoveryEscrowAlreadySet",
          "value": 13
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "NotRecoveryEscrow",
          "value": 14
        },
        {
          "doc": "A fixed-point intermediate overflowed `i128`. Found during an audit review: declared\\nhere but never actually raised anywhere in this contract until `settle`'s pending-yield\\ncalculation was wired to it below, so it previously relied entirely on the workspace's\\n`overflow-checks = true` release-profile setting to fail closed, as a generic Rust panic\\nrather than this contract's own observable error code.",
          "name": "ArithmeticOverflow",
          "value": 15
        },
        {
          "doc": "`set_recovery_escrow` was given an address that does not point back at a RecoveryEscrow\\nconfigured for this same underlying -- most likely a stale address copied from a\\ndifferent market. Found during audit review: this wiring is one-shot and irreversible,\\nso an admin mistake here previously had no cross-check at all, unlike `initialize`.",
          "name": "RecoveryEscrowMismatch",
          "value": 16
        }
      ]
    }
